            <div class="v2-rx__line"><%= tt('A digital prescription is a paid add-on and this patient has not bought one, so it is not part of what you are delivering here. If you judge that one is clinically indicated, request it and clinical operations will arrange it with the patient.', 'A digital prescription is a paid add-on and this patient has not bought one, so it is not part of what you are delivering here. If you judge that one is clinically indicated, request it and clinical operations will arrange it with the patient.', 'الروشتة الرقمية خدمة إضافية مدفوعة لم يشترها هذا المريض، فهي ليست جزءاً مما تقوم بتسليمه هنا. إذا رأيتها ضرورية طبياً، أرسل طلباً وسيتولى فريق العمليات ترتيبها مع المريض.') %></div>
            <details class="v2-rx__details">
              <summary class="v2-rx__summary"><%= tt('Request a prescription for this patient', 'Request a prescription for this patient', 'اطلب روشتة لهذا المريض') %></summary>
              <form method="POST" action="<%= _rxUrl %>" class="v2-rx__form">
                <%- (typeof csrfField === 'function') ? csrfField() : '' %>
                <label class="v2-field__label" for="rx-reason-case"><%= tt('Why is it indicated? (optional)', 'Why is it indicated? (optional)', 'لماذا هي ضرورية؟ (اختياري)') %></label>
                <textarea class="v2-field__textarea" id="rx-reason-case" name="clinical_reason" rows="3" maxlength="1000" placeholder="<%= tt('Helps operations explain it to the patient.', 'Helps operations explain it to the patient.', 'يساعد الفريق في شرح الأمر للمريض.') %>"></textarea>
                <button type="submit" class="v2-btn v2-btn--secondary v2-btn--sm"><%= tt('Send request', 'Send request', 'إرسال الطلب') %></button>
              </form>
